/**
 * The icon button of spec/02 §1.5 (OR-6): 48 dp, the 24 dp [icon] in textMuted, the room radius.control (8 dp); hover
 * hoverFill with the icon in text, pressed pressedFill with the icon in text, the focus ring of §3 (2 dp outside, never
 * M3's focus layer), no ripple. [contentDescription] names it (spec/07 §4.8: „Zurück“, „Menü öffnen“, „Suche leeren“).
 * Disabled ([enabled] = false): the icon in textSubtle, no fill, out of the focus order; with [focusableWhenDisabled]
 * (the web's aria-disabled) it stays focusable, TalkBack hears it as disabled and a press does nothing.
